{"resourceIdentifier":"2830","resourceName":"Huineng Low Concentration Coal Mine Methane Utilization Project","description":"Huineng Low Concentration Coal Mine Methane Utilization Project is located in Huineng coal mine area in Pingding County, Yangquan City, Shanxi Province, People’s Republic of China.Without implementing the project activity, the coal mine methane (CMM) gas extracted due to safety reasons from the Huineng coal mine would be vented into the atmosphere. One of the main components of the CMM gas is methane, a potent greenhouse gas, which would contribute \r\nto accelerating the climate change if released into the atmosphere. The project activity will capture a large part of the CMM gas and destroy it through utilizing it for electricity production.","location":{"latitude":37.709400,"longitude":113.616000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-02-22","endExclusive":"2022-03-25","endInclusive":"2022-03-24"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2830"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shanxi Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Beijing Yonder Environmental Energy Technology Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Beijing City, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 183 0341 5669"},{"type":"string","value":"wangchao@china-yonder.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2830"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"352106"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Mining/mineral production"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0008"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","value